+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use argon2id as the password hashing algorithm. The recorded rationale is that argon2id is a memory-hard function that provides much better resistance to GPU attacks. No parameter values (memory, iterations, parallelism) are recorded.
